OL,3,GNEWSADivers identify vessel lost at sea
OL,4,Afor 46 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wreckage of a fishing vessel which
OL,7,Fwent missing at sea 46 years ago has
OL,8,Fbeen identified by divers.
OL,10,FThe 25m (82ft) steel Belgian ship Z.592
OL,11,FHosanna, disappeared in February 1980
OL,12,Fwhile on a voyage to the Netherlands
OL,13,Ffrom Plymouth, Devon.
OL,15,FResearchers said a wreck located nine
OL,16,Fnautical miles (10.3 miles) off the
OL,17,Fcoast of Dover, Kent, has now been
OL,18,Fconfirmed as the missing ship after two
OL,19,Fdives validated its identity.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
