OL,3,GNEWSADivers identify vessel lost at sea
OL,4,Afor 46 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish wreck researcher Mark Lewis,
OL,7,Ffrom Mutiny Diving, said "every dive is
OL,8,Fdifferent, and every dive is different
OL,9,Ffor a reason" but this one was "quite
OL,10,Fspecial" because of the time spent
OL,11,Flocating and identify the wreck.
